  "_about": {
    "chapter": "Shops and prices: what the shops charge and offer that is not already on an item. Item, augment, consumable and schematic prices stay on their entries in items.json; cosmetic prices stay on the cosmetics until the looks chapter moves.",
    "how_to_edit": "Plain JSON, inlined by tools/build.mjs as GAME_DB.shops and checked by tools/test-game-db.cjs. Credits are personics (PP); the dyer charges scrap. Colours are CSS hex.",
    "tables": {
      "auto_shop": "Torque Auto (engine/shops-menus.js). car_prices: PP per brand and model (a model with no price is not for sale; brands and models are VEHICLE_BRANDS in traffic/garage-zib.js). sell_rate: the share of the price paid back when a car is sold. custom_prices: PP per change of paint, underglow or headlights. paint_colors: offered on top of the brand's own colours; glow_colors (null is no underglow) and headlight_colors: the swatches offered.",
      "dyer": "The Clothing Dyer (engine/dyer.js). fee: scrap per piece dyed. palette: [hex, name] swatches, in the order shown."
    }
  },
